flowchart LR
  reviewer[Human reviewer] --> ui[React judge interface]
  ui --> api[Next.js scoped API]
  sources[Untrusted PDF / CSV] --> parser[Bounded parser + normalized evidence]
  parser --> api
  api --> state[Deterministic transition engine]
  state --> finance[Integer-cent finance engine]
  state --> local[Local store: tested rehearsal]
  state -. prepared / live blocked .-> convex[Convex: transactions + storage]
  api -. evidence / account blocked .-> creao[CREAO core investigator]
  creao -. findings only .-> validation[Version + citation validation]
  validation --> state
  reviewer --> approval[Source inspection + reason + version]
  approval --> state
  optional[CRS / Claude / Coinbase: not executed] -. capability gate .-> api
